      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SONGAR OSCAR (2) goes very well this course and distance starting 15 times for five wins and four minors. Scored by one length last time (23.03) in a Grade 4/5 over 400m at this track. Looks suited and should go close. ZIPPING VIVID (1) has missed the frame the last couple but just a few runs back pushed the clock when winning over 400m at this track, taking a NG in a sharp 22.84. Top win three back and rates a key player again. ZIPPING SCHRUB (6) has a terrific record this track and trip with three wins and two placings from five starts. Below best last time at Taree Super Track (17.92) in a NG, finishing a 10 length seventh. Looks well placed here and among the chances. LOCHINVAR GRACE (8) placed last time out at this track and distance - worth considering.",
